ul detective enhanced by experimental drugs. Master supernatural movement abilities, and uncover the truth behind your brother's murder - before the power that drives you becomes your doom.","steam_appid":3339570,"support_info":{"email":"support@rubicongamestudios.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://rubicongamestudios.com/"}